      "content": "Wait, what are you talking about? Gopher goblins? I think you're misunderstanding me. I'm an organic farmer, not playing a game. Can you please just tell me if the blood meal is safe to use at 6.2 pH without me having to listen to stories about \"goblin feasts\"?",
